WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.067
Payment schedule, tax and ST-8 on an estimate.

00:00:04.767 --> 00:00:10.333
Open the estimate. Terms are set on each estimate. The tour opens this one.

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:18.433
Contract terms. What the customer signs up to if they accept: the payment schedule and whether sales tax applies.

00:00:18.933 --> 00:00:28.100
Pick the payment schedule. The schedules from Settings; the default for this kind of work is already picked. Choosing one saves it on the estimate.

00:00:28.567 --> 00:00:37.800
Each payment, worked out. Deposit, start of work, completion… with what each comes to and when it's due. They follow the total as you edit.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:52.267
A custom split. "Custom for this estimate…" opens an editor: start from 30/60/10, 50/50 or deposit + final; set %, fixed $ or the balance, and when each is due.

00:00:52.767 --> 00:01:06.367
NJ ST-8: no sales tax. Switch on for new construction (patio, wall, driveway): no sales tax, and the customer signs an ST-8 to keep on the job. It takes effect at once.

00:01:06.867 --> 00:01:14.433
Terms added from Settings. The standard terms from Settings that print on this estimate. Click the line to read them.

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:25.700
Tax in the totals. Sales tax is the estimate's Tax % on the taxable sections only. Tax exempt sections, and ST-8 jobs, pay none.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:32.367
Tax %. The sales tax rate for this estimate. Change it only for a special case.

00:01:32.867 --> 00:01:37.733
Valid until. How long the price holds. It prints on the estimate.

00:01:38.233 --> 00:01:45.300
Terms for this estimate. Extra terms for this estimate only, printed with it. Press Save to keep them.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:51.400
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
